 "name_zh": "卡塞塔的18世纪花园皇宫、凡韦特里水渠和圣莱乌西建筑群",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "18th-Century Royal Palace at Caserta with the Park, the Aqueduct of Vanvitelli, and the San Leucio Complex",
